  "method": "Warm once;11 rotating sequential full-public hashes, native Apple only. Independently written shared publication queue per name owner pools16/32/64 slots among readers instead of allocating one ring per connection. Brief std::mutex try-lock protects only a nonblocking space-check/vector-swap/release-publication; full/busy sends release lock then check cancellation/yield. Consumer is unchanged release/acquire FIFO and never takes the producer lock. Each reader enqueues data before one EOF, so all reader EOFs imply all data consumed. Names/parser/roles/PGO unchanged.",
